=== 2. point defect V at a bulk site: rho_V(E) = rho_0(E) / |1 - V G_0(E)|^2 near the edge E -> 0 ===
  d=1: |G_0| at distance s = 1e-2..1e-5 below the edge: [  4.9938  15.8094  49.9994 158.1137]
  d=2: |G_0| at distance s = 1e-2..1e-5 below the edge: [0.6416 0.8254 1.0087 1.192 ]
  d=3: |G_0| at distance s = 1e-2..1e-5 below the edge: [0.2447 0.2502 0.2519 0.2525]
  d=1: |G_0| ~ s^{-1/2} diverges -> rho_V ~ E^{+1/2}: any V != 0 is RELEVANT (gamma -1/2 -> +1/2)
  d=2: |G_0| ~ log(1/s) diverges slowly -> rho_V ~ 1/log^2 E: MARGINAL (gamma = 0 with log corrections)
  d=3: |G_0| -> G_c finite (Watson) -> gamma = 1/2 unchanged unless V = -1/G_c (threshold resonance: gamma -> -1/2)

